    {
      "id": "note_why_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 585,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "为什么需要 Rerank？",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1036,
      "version": 2,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "versionNonce": 847881016,
      "index": "aZ",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1780998471999,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "为什么需要 Rerank？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4285714285714286
    },
    {
      "id": "note_why_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 585,
      "y": 735,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 95,
      "text": "1. 向量检索是近似匹配,\n   语义理解有限\n2. Reranker 用交叉注意力\n   精确判断相关性\n3. 减少送入 LLM 的噪声文档\n4. 提升生成答案的准确性",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1037,
      "version": 2,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "versionNonce": 1321159752,
      "index": "aa",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1780998471999,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 向量检索是近似匹配,\n   语义理解有限\n2. Reranker 用交叉注意力\n   精确判断相关性\n3. 减少送入 LLM 的噪声文档\n4. 提升生成答案的准确性",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.217948717948718
    },
